<title>UK: Abbey National sets 100 mln stg three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Abbey National sets 100 mln stg three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers.  BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY SERVICES</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     *7.375    MATURITY   *17.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.20    PAY DATE    17.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.125     REOFFER    99.95     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR YEARS ONE AND TWO, THEN 7.875 IF NOT CALLED</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
